{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 26957, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 25191, "uid": 29892, "type": 4, "title": "韩服新版乱斗12胜阵容小技巧", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1584434254, "updated_at": 1590040794, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1590040794, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 1, "status": 1, "summary": "3月12日韩服更新后添加了新版乱斗内容：参加本活动需消耗一张门票进行1VS115天子对战，奖励按胜场数给予，最高达成12胜可获得奖励首次达成12胜更可获得自选5星卷奖励就是这么丰厚冲啊！！！下面说说1", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1589536086596_9195227.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 14505, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 26957, "content": "<span>3月12日韩服更新后添加了新版乱斗内容：</span><div><div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1589536086596_9195227.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1589536086596_9195227.png\" alt=\"韩服新版乱斗12胜阵容小技巧\"></div><br></div><div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">参加本活动需消耗一张门票进行1VS1 15天子对战，奖励按胜场数给予，最高达成12胜可获得奖励</span><br></div><div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1584432491228_67246066.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1584432491228_67246066.png\" style=\"width: 475px; height: 97px;\" alt=\"韩服新版乱斗12胜阵容小技巧\"></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">首次达成12胜更可获得</span><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">自选5星卷</b></font><br></div><div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1584432654066_94591335.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1584432654066_94591335.png\" alt=\"韩服新版乱斗12胜阵容小技巧\"></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">奖励就是这么丰厚</span></div><div><font color=\"#c3d69b\" style=\"color: rgb(195, 214, 155);\"><font size=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">冲啊！！！</b></font><br></font></div><div><br></div><div><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">下面说说12胜小技巧：</font></b></div><div>需要15天子才能参加的对战，对萌新来说练度根本达不到，奖励这么诱人怎么办？</div><div><u style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">只需要拿出你平时常用的PVP5人队放在第一排，后面2排放上没练度的3星天子就可以了。</u></div><div>因本活动匹配机制是根据战力匹配相近战力对手，用三星天子拉低你的战力就能轻松获得12胜。</div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">注：匹配是根据你上一场对战的战力进行的，比如你上一把是最后第12场对手比较强，你调整阵容提高战力确保拿下12胜，那你接下来下一轮第一场就算调回原阵容，你面对的也将会是你上一场战力的相近阵容，可以通过逐步降低的方式来回到原战力上。</font></div></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1589536086596_9195227.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 29892, "username": "黑", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/4.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 2, "read_num": 26753, "like_num": 13}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "th